<title>SPAIN: Calendar of Spanish companies 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Calendar of Spanish companies 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a preliminary list of expected dates for release of major Spanish companies' 1996 results. Further dates will be added as they become available:</p>
<p>    Jan 16:		Banesto at 1130 GMT</p>
<p>    Jan 20-22:	   Banco Santander</p>
<p>    Jan 20-24:	   Banco Bilbao Vizcaya</p>
<p>    Jan 21:		Bankinter at 0900 GMT</p>
<p>    Jan 24:		Argentaria</p>
<p>    Jan 27-31:	   BCH</p>
<p>    Middle February:   Amper</p>
<p>NOTE: Under bourse legislation, listed companies should release 1996 results by March 3.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
